<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="Department of Electrical & Electronics Engineering | SRKR Engineering College" description="Department of Electrical & Electronics Engineering at SRKR Engineering College, Bhimavaram — established 1980, NBA accredited, offering B.Tech EEE and M.Tech Power Systems." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <SrkrHeader />

    <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
    <section class="rts-breadcrumb breadcrumb-height breadcumb-bg" style="background-image: url(/assets/images/faculty/eee/eeehome.jpeg);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-12">
            <div class="breadcrumb-content">
              <ul class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/departments">Departments</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering</li>
              </ul>
              <h1 class="section-title">Department of Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering</h1>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- BREADCRUMB AREA END -->

    <!-- content -->
    <div class="rts-faculty-details py-5">
      <div class="container">

        <DeptNav dept="eee" current="Home" />

        <!-- About the Department -->
        <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-md-center mb-5 pb-5">
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="faculty-content-text me-5">
              <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-5">About the Department</h3>

              <p style="text-align: justify;">The Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering (EEE), established in 1994, is a center of excellence in electrical engineering education, research, and innovation. The department offers B.Tech in Electrical and Electronics Engineering and M.Tech in Power Systems and Automation, supported by experienced faculty, modern infrastructure, and well-equipped laboratories.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">Accredited three times by the National Board of Accreditation (NBA) and recognized as a research center by Andhra University and JNTU Kakinada, the department is committed to academic excellence and industry relevance.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">Research and skill development are key focus areas, with active work in Power Systems, Power Electronics, Renewable Energy, Electric Vehicles, and Automation. The department has secured funded projects from DST and MSME and maintains strong industry collaborations through MoUs with organizations such as MSME Technology Centre, BOSON Motors, HALA Mobility, and Finch Power Ltd.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">Advanced facilities, including Solar Energy, Smart Systems, Robotics, Electric Vehicle, E-Mobility, and Renewable Energy laboratories, provide students with hands-on learning and research opportunities. The curriculum is regularly updated to include emerging technologies such as Energy Storage Systems, Battery Management Systems, Electric Vehicles, and Renewable Energy.</p>
              <p style="text-align: justify;">Students actively participate in national innovation competitions, including Smart India Hackathon and e-Yantra, and gain industry exposure through internships at IIT Guwahati, Indian Railways, BOSON Motors, and HALA Mobility. Graduates have secured positions in prestigious organizations such as BHEL, NTPC, DRDO, Tata Power, Indian Railways, Bosch, Mercedes-Benz, and leading software companies.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/zWHp1cRW8fc?html5=1&enablejsapi=1"
                title="SRKR Department Video"
                loading="lazy"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Message from HoD -->
        <div class="row mt--30">
          <div class="rts-section mb--60">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Message from Head of Department</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-8">
            <div class="faculty-image text-center">
              {/* TODO: replace with real HoD photograph at /assets/images/faculty/eee/hod.jpg */}
              <img class="img-fluid mw-100" src="/assets/images/faculty/eee/221.jpg" alt="Dr. B. Ravi Kumar Varma">
              <div class="h5 mb-2 mt-5">Dr. B. Ravi Kumar Varma</div>
              <span>Professor &amp; Head of Department</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-8">
            <div class="faculty-content-text ms-lg-5 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Welcome to the Department of Electrical &amp; Electronics Engineering</p>


              <p class="mb-5">The Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering is committed to nurturing competent engineers equipped with strong technical knowledge, professional ethics, and leadership qualities to meet the challenges of a rapidly evolving technological world. Our primary focus is on building a strong foundation in the fundamentals of Electrical Engineering, which forms the backbone for innovation, research, and advanced technological applications.</p>
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Strong Foundations &amp; Professional Values</p>
              <p class="mb-5">We strongly believe that a thorough understanding of core subjects such as electrical circuits, machines, power systems, control systems, and electronics enables students to adapt to emerging technologies and industry requirements. Along with academic excellence, the department emphasizes discipline, integrity, and responsibility, which are essential attributes for personal and professional success.</p>
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Skill Development &amp; Industry Readiness</p>
              <p class="mb-5">In today's competitive environment, engineering education must extend beyond classroom learning. Therefore, we place significant emphasis on skill development through hands-on laboratory experiences, industry-oriented training programs, internships, certification courses, workshops, and project-based learning. These initiatives help our students develop problem-solving abilities, technical competence, and employability skills.</p>
              
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Electric Vehicles &amp; Green Mobility</p>
              <p class="mb-5">The global transition towards sustainable transportation has created immense opportunities in the field of Electric Vehicles (EVs). Our department actively encourages students to explore EV technologies, power electronics, charging infrastructure, and energy management systems, enabling them to contribute to the future of green mobility.</p>
              
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border-top my-60"></div>

