                  <li class="mb-3">To build an environment that cultivates employability skills with human values and ethics.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To establish collaborative interaction with industry for laboratory development, research and innovation.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To create an ambience that encourages active participation of students and staff in the pursuits towards excellence.</li>
                </ul>

